    ⚡ HOW THE PROGRAM WORKS:
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    
    🔹 CORE TECHNOLOGY
    Total Commander Ultimate File Manager operates through a highly optimized dual-panel interface that provides side-by-side file management capabilities. The software uses direct system API calls for maximum performance and includes a powerful scripting engine for automation. It features built-in support for over 15 archive formats, integrated FTP/SFTP/FTPS clients, and a comprehensive plugin architecture that extends functionality to virtually any file-related task .
    
    🔹 KEY FEATURES
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    📁 DUAL-PANEL INTERFACE   │ Side-by-side file management
    🗜️ ARCHIVE SUPPORT        │ ZIP, 7Z, RAR, TAR, GZ and more
    🌐 FTP/SFTP CLIENT        │ Built-in file transfer protocol support
    🔍 FILE SEARCH            │ Advanced multi-threaded search
    🔧 FILE COMPARISON        │ Compare files by content
    📝 MULTI-RENAME           │ Powerful batch renaming tools
    🔌 PLUGIN ARCHITECTURE    │ Extend functionality with plugins
    ⚡ KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS      │ Full keyboard-driven operation
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    
    🔹 FILE OPERATIONS

    📋 ADVANCED MANAGEMENT
    • MULTI-SELECT: Advanced selection patterns and filters
    • BACKGROUND TRANSFERS: Copy/move files in background
    • QUEUE SYSTEM: Prioritize and schedule operations
    • SPLIT/MERGE: Split large files, merge them back
    • ENCODE/DECODE: Base64, UUE, XXE encoding support
    • CHECKSUM: Calculate and verify MD5, SHA1, CRC32
    
    🔹 ARCHIVE HANDLING

    🗜️ COMPREHENSIVE SUPPORT
    • CREATE: ZIP, 7Z, CAB, TAR, GZ, BZ2
    • EXTRACT: RAR, ZIP, 7Z, ARJ, LZH, CAB, ISO
    • OPEN INSIDE: Browse archives like folders
    • PACKER PLUGINS: Add support for additional formats
    • ENCRYPTED ARCHIVES: Handle password-protected files
    • MULTI-VOLUME: Work with split archives
    
    🔹 NETWORK FEATURES

    🌐 REMOTE ACCESS
    • FTP/FTPS: Full-featured FTP client
    • SFTP/SSH: Secure file transfer over SSH
    • WEBDAV: Access WebDAV servers
    • LAN ACCESS: Browse network neighborhood
    • FAVORITES: Save connection settings
    • RESUME SUPPORT: Continue interrupted transfers
    
    🔹 SEARCH CAPABILITIES

    🔍 POWERFUL SEARCH
    • FULL-TEXT: Search inside files
    • REGULAR EXPRESSIONS: Advanced pattern matching
    • MULTI-THREADED: Fast searching on multiple drives
    • SAVE RESULTS: Export search results
